'''University of Ruuria''' was a [[university]] located in [[the galaxy]].<ref name="EOA" /> In [[6 BBY]],<ref name="EOAdate">{{EOAdate}}</ref> undercover [[Imperial Security Bureau]] operative [[Chemish Runazha]] pretended to be a transfer student from the University of Ruuria to get close to [[Student Action Alliance]] student [[Fennro Drogan]] as a means of [[Spy|spying]] on student leader [[Deata Dau]].<ref name="EOA" />

{{Company-stub}}

==Behind the scenes==
The University of Ruuria was mentioned in the [[2026]] novel ''[[Reign of the Empire: Edge of the Abyss]]'', written by [[Rebecca Roanhorse]] as the second installment of the ''[[Star Wars: Reign of the Empire]]'' trilogy.<ref name="EOA" />

